/-
Draft/HerdtAtoms.lean — the 26 irreducible positive polynomials `a01 … a26` in `(x, y) = (u, v)` that occur in the
sign certificates of the Herdt 11-piece family (Draft.HerdtFamily), their positivity from `u < v`, `Vp > 0`
(`Vp = (v²-u²)³v² - u⁸`), and the hypothesis bundles `AT`, `HP`.  Each positivity is a certificate
`m·p = λ·Vp + q` with `m, λ, q` polynomials of nonnegative coefficients in `(x, d = y - x)` (generated by exact LP).
UNAUDITED.  No sorry, no native_decide.
-/
